 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? That's understandable. Lots of people feel that. What would help you take those breaks? short walk, a quick coffee, or something else? Something small that lets your mind wander a little. Maybe few minutes of gentle yoga, or a quick game of word search. Definitely not. That's the real danger, the alert pops up and before you know it, you' lost ten minutes. And make it social. Chat with someone while you do it. Then window seat it. Plan something to look out the window at. Birds, clouds, people, anything breaks the rhythm.",
